MIT License

This repository contains work derived from the Omarchy project
(https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy), which is MIT licensed, alongside
original work. Because the mix differs per file, the derivation is named
per path rather than claimed in one blanket sentence. Line counts are
against Omarchy 4.0.0.r1744 unless noted.

Upstream Omarchy's work, carried verbatim
-----------------------------------------

  plugins/austinkarren.network/Panel.qml
      Byte-identical to shell/plugins/panels/network/Panel.qml (1,958 lines).
      Entirely upstream's; this repo changes nothing in it.

  plugins/austinkarren.clock/Model.js
      Byte-identical to shell/plugins/panels/clock/Model.js (296 lines).

Upstream Omarchy's work, with modifications by Austin Karren
------------------------------------------------------------

The bulk of each file below is upstream's; the modifications are small and
localised, and are marked in-file where practical.

  plugins/austinkarren.clock/Panel.qml
      From shell/plugins/panels/clock/Panel.qml (773 lines). Modified: day
      cells and the hero date open GNOME Calendar on the clicked day, plus
      the hover fill that makes the grid read as a picker (ADR-0006).

  plugins/austinkarren.clock/BarWidget.qml
      From shell/plugins/panels/clock/BarWidget.qml (185 lines). Modified:
      one five-line branch routing the left click through clock-click so a
      second click closes the calendar popup.

  plugins/austinkarren.network/Model.js
      From shell/plugins/panels/network/Model.js (371 lines). Modified: one
      line — the wired glyph is a globe (U+F059F) rather than upstream's
      RJ45 socket (U+F0200), ADR-0029.

  plugins/shokupan-notifications/Notifications.qml
      From shell/plugins/notifications/BarWidget.qml (412 lines) as it stood
      at basecamp/omarchy commit fc4caf3c^, before upstream removed it.
      Modified: the module name, and four null-guard lines that let it run
      as a third-party widget. Substantively this file is upstream's.

  plugins/shokupan-notifications/NotificationLogic.js
      From shell/plugins/notifications/NotificationLogic.js (242 lines) at
      the same revision. Modified: five lines.

  bar/modules/indicators.qml
      From shell/plugins/bar/widgets/Indicators.qml (471 lines). Modified:
      a header comment and roughly fourteen lines so the indicator loader
      resolves from a user directory first and falls back to the package
      copy. The six stock indicators it loads remain upstream's, from the
      installed package.

  plugins/shokupan-omenu/BarWidget.qml
      Adapted from shell/plugins/menu/BarWidget.qml. The WidgetButton
      structure, the horizontalMargin value and both click actions are
      upstream's, carried over near-verbatim; the glyph, the tooltip and
      the plain-Item root the third-party plugin loader injects into are
      modifications.

  themes/tokyo-night/shell.bar.toml
      The [bar] section shape, its non-colour defaults and two of its
      comments are carried from upstream's default/themed/shell.toml.tpl.
      The pinned colours are original.

Original work by Austin Karren
------------------------------

Written for this repository, consuming Omarchy's documented plugin, widget
and indicator APIs rather than copying its implementations:

  plugins/shokupan-apexshot/     plugins/shokupan-capture/
  plugins/shokupan-dpms-guard/   bar/indicators/Ratio.qml
  bin/                           hooks/
  docs/                          packages/plugins
  README.md                      plugins/*/manifest.json

